"use strict";
module.exports = /*#__PURE__*/JSON.parse('{"$comment":"The attestation gate on the submission review, verbatim from the reference prototype (Ministry Review, review screen). An attestation is NOT an outcome: the three outcomes remain the only determinations, and a pending attestation blocks only \'satisfied\'. Two states only -- pending and complete; a deficiency does not create a third state, it is recorded as the reason an item is pending. Items, their levels and their assigned authority are Ministry-configurable (non-negotiable 3): nothing below is hard-coded in a component. THE LANE FALLBACK IS A BUILD RULING AWAITING THE MINISTRY (open decision 19): items assigned to the Order of Physicians are recordable by the Order only while its lane is active; while the lane is off -- the default -- the Ministry may record them, because otherwise no Level 3 submission could ever be satisfied. The prototype shows Order items as read-only to the Ministry AND shows the lane off on its own Order screen; those two cannot both hold, reported not reconciled.","appliesAtLevels":[3],"items":[{"key":"directorCredential","en":"Event Medical Director appointed and physician credential verified","ar":"تعيين المدير الطبي للفعالية والتحقق من مؤهلات الطبيب","authority":"order"},{"key":"clinicalContent","en":"Clinical content of the event health and medical plan reviewed — sections 3 to 9 and 11","ar":"مراجعة المحتوى السريري للخطة الصحية والطبية للفعالية — البنود 3 إلى 9 و11","authority":"order"},{"key":"insuranceEvidenced","en":"Insurance coverage for participants and spectators evidenced","ar":"إثبات التغطية التأمينية للمشاركين والمتفرجين","authority":"moph"},{"key":"emsDeclarations","en":"EMS readiness declaration received from every named provider","ar":"استلام إقرار الجاهزية من كل مزوّد إسعاف مُسمّى","authority":"moph"},{"key":"majorIncidentPlan","en":"Major-incident and mass-casualty plan reviewed","ar":"مراجعة خطة الحوادث الجسيمة وحوادث الإصابات الجماعية","authority":"moph"},{"key":"deploymentMap","en":"Medical deployment map and treatment post arrangements reviewed","ar":"مراجعة خريطة الانتشار الطبي وترتيبات مراكز العلاج","authority":"moph"}],"authorities":{"moph":{"en":"Ministry of Public Health","ar":"وزارة الصحة العامة"},"order":{"en":"Lebanese Order of Physicians","ar":"نقابة الأطباء في لبنان"}},"states":{"pending":{"en":"Pending","ar":"قيد الانتظار"},"complete":{"en":"Complete","ar":"مكتمل"}},"panel":{"titleEn":"Attestations","titleAr":"التصديقات","versionLabelEn":"Regulatory version","versionLabelAr":"إصدار الإطار","notAnOutcomeEn":"An attestation is not an outcome. The three outcomes remain the only regulatory determinations and are recorded by the Ministry on the submission as a whole. A clearance cannot be issued while any attestation is pending; the other two outcomes are available at all times.","notAnOutcomeAr":"التصديق ليس نتيجة. تبقى النتائج الثلاث القرارات التنظيمية الوحيدة وتسجّلها الوزارة على التقديم ككل. ولا يمكن إصدار استيفاء ما دام أي تصديق قيد الانتظار؛ والنتيجتان الأخريان متاحتان في كل وقت.","allCompleteEn":"All six attestations complete — a clearance may be recorded.","allCompleteAr":"التصديقات الستة مكتملة — يمكن تسجيل الاستيفاء.","notYetEn":"Not yet attested","notYetAr":"لم يُصدَّق بعد","attestedByEn":"Attested by","attestedByAr":"صدّقه","pendingBecauseEn":"Pending because","pendingBecauseAr":"قيد الانتظار لأن","attestEn":"Attest","attestAr":"تصديق","deficiencyEn":"Record a deficiency — the item stays pending","deficiencyAr":"تسجيل قصور — يبقى البند قيد الانتظار","orderHeldEn":"Held by the Order of Physicians — read-only to the Ministry. A Level 3 clearance cannot be issued while it is pending.","orderHeldAr":"لدى نقابة الأطباء — للقراءة فقط لدى الوزارة. ولا يمكن إصدار استيفاء لمستوى 3 ما دام قيد الانتظار.","orderFallbackEn":"Assigned to the Order of Physicians, whose lane is off. Until the Ministry turns the lane on, the Ministry records this item itself — recorded as a build ruling awaiting the Ministry.","orderFallbackAr":"مُسند إلى نقابة الأطباء ومسارها مطفأ. وإلى أن تشغّل الوزارة المسار، تسجّل الوزارة هذا البند بنفسها — مسجَّل كاجتهاد من البناء بانتظار قرار الوزارة.","footnoteEn":"Six items apply at Level 3. Items and their assigned authority remain configurable under Configuration and versioning. There are two states only — pending and complete. A deficiency does not create a third state; it is recorded as the reason an item is pending.","footnoteAr":"تنطبق ستة بنود في المستوى 3. وتبقى البنود والجهة المصدِّقة قابلة للإعداد في الإعدادات والإصدارات. وهناك حالتان فقط — قيد الانتظار ومكتمل. والقصور لا يُنشئ حالة ثالثة؛ بل يُسجَّل كسبب بقاء البند قيد الانتظار.","summaryPendingEn":"{pending} of {total} pending · {moph} held by the Ministry, {order} by the Order of Physicians","summaryPendingAr":"{pending} من {total} قيد الانتظار · {moph} لدى الوزارة و{order} لدى نقابة الأطباء","deficiencyReopenEn":"Record a deficiency — the item returns to pending","deficiencyReopenAr":"تسجيل قصور — يعود البند إلى قيد الانتظار"},"emptyState":{"eyebrowEn":"Submission — no attestation items apply","eyebrowAr":"التقديم — لا بنود تصديق منطبقة","headEn":"No attestation items apply to this submission.","headAr":"لا بنود تصديق تنطبق على هذا التقديم.","bodyEn":"The six attestation items apply at Level 3 only. This is a Level {level} submission, so nothing is pending and all three outcomes are available — a clearance is gated by attestations only where attestations exist.","bodyAr":"تنطبق بنود التصديق الستة في المستوى 3 فقط. وهذا تقديم من المستوى {level}، فلا شيء قيد الانتظار والنتائج الثلاث متاحة — ولا يُحجب الاستيفاء بالتصديقات إلا حيث توجد تصديقات.","footEn":"Items and the levels they apply at are set under Configuration and versioning.","footAr":"تُحدَّد البنود والمستويات التي تنطبق عليها في الإعدادات والإصدارات."},"blocker":{"prefixEn":"Attestation pending","prefixAr":"تصديق قيد الانتظار"}}');

